        "inspection"
      ],
      "obligation": "mandatory",
      "action_text": "(1) Perform an High Frequency Eddy Current (HFEC) inspection and a detailed visual inspection on the lower side of Rib 5 of LH and RH pylon in accordance with the instructions defined in AIRBUS SB A310-54-2036 Revision 2 at the latest of the following thresholds, as applicable to the aircraft model: For A310-203, A310-203C and A310-204: - Prior to accumulation of 40 000 flight cycles (FC) or 60 000 flight hours (FH), whichever occurs first; or - Within 250 FH after the effective date of this AD. For A310-304 and A310-308: - Prior to accumulation of 35 000 FC or 60 000 FH, whichever occurs first, or - Within 250 FH after the effective date of this AD.",
